| **LLM02:2025** | Sensitive Information Disclosure | 6.→2. yükseldi |
| **LLM03:2025** | Supply Chain | base/fine-tuned model, LoRA adapter tampering, dataset |
| **LLM04:2025** | Data and Model Poisoning | eğitim verisi/backdoor |
