## 13.4. VERİ EGEMENLİĞİ VE GÖLGE AI (SHADOW AI)

### Public LLM sızıntısını engelleme
- **Microsoft Purview DSPM for AI:** "All AI apps" dashboard, **one-click policies** (örn. "Detect sensitive info added to AI sites", "...in AI prompts in Edge"), **browser extension** (Edge/Chrome/Firefox — copy/paste/upload yakalar), **Endpoint DLP**, **Insider Risk Management**, **100+ üçüncü-parti GenAI app** (ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini), Activity Explorer (yüksek-riskli kullanıcı drill-down). Lisans: **M365 E5** (interaction/prompt/response için). Default: haftalık risk assessment top 100 SharePoint site. Copilot DLP: hassas prompt blokla, web grounding kısıtla, etiketli dosya koru.
- **Microsoft Defender for Cloud Apps:** Cloud Discovery → Discovered apps → **Category = Generative AI** (1.000+ app, 0-10 risk skoru), App Discovery Policy, Sanctioned/Unsanctioned/Monitored tag; Unsanctioned app'ler MDE-onboarded cihazlarda **otomatik bloklanır** (Cloud + Network Protection gerekir).
- **"Prevent data leak to shadow AI" deployment modeli (Microsoft):** 4 servis — Defender for Cloud Apps (keşif) + Purview (veri koruma) + Entra (Conditional Access) + Intune (cihaz kontrolü).
- Ticari alternatifler: **Netskope**, **Zscaler** (SASE/SSE), genel CASB.

### Shadow AI tespiti — çalıştırılabilir detection kuralları (subagent derlemesi)
**(a) Splunk SPL — yerel LLM tespiti (Splunk STRT resmi blog, EventID 4688):**
```spl
index="llm4688" sourcetype=XmlWinEventLog EventID=4688
| spath
| eval NewProcessName=mvindex('Event.EventData.Data', mvfind('Event.EventData.Data{@Name}', "NewProcessName"))
| eval CommandLine=mvindex('Event.EventData.Data', mvfind('Event.EventData.Data{@Name}', "CommandLine"))
| search (NewProcessName="*ollama*" OR NewProcessName="*llama*" OR NewProcessName="*gpt4all*"
    OR NewProcessName="*lmstudio*" OR NewProcessName="*koboldcpp*"
    OR CommandLine="*transformers*" OR CommandLine="*langchain*" OR CommandLine="*huggingface*")
| stats count by Computer, ParentProcessName
```
Portlar (process/port korelasyonu için): **Ollama 11434, LM Studio 1234/43411, LocalAI/llama.cpp 8080/8000, Jan.ai 1337, Text-Gen-WebUI 7860/5000, GPT4All 4891**. Sysmon varyantı: `QueryName="*huggingface.co*" OR "*ollama.com*"`, `TargetFilename="*.gguf*"`.

**(b) Splunk SPL — public AI servis DNS/proxy tespiti:**
```spl
index=dns OR index=ad_dns earliest=-7d
(query="api.openai.com" OR query="chat.openai.com" OR query="chatgpt.com"
 OR query="api.anthropic.com" OR query="claude.ai"
 OR query="generativelanguage.googleapis.com" OR query="gemini.google.com"
 OR query="deepseek.com" OR query="api.mistral.ai" OR query="api.cohere.com"
 OR query="api.groq.com" OR query="ollama.com" OR query="*.openai.azure.com"
 OR query="bedrock-runtime.*.amazonaws.com")
| stats count as n_queries values(query) as domains by src_ip, user
| where n_queries>=5
```
Domain listesi: api.openai.com, chat.openai.com, chatgpt.com, api.anthropic.com, claude.ai, console.anthropic.com, generativelanguage.googleapis.com, aiplatform.googleapis.com, gemini.google.com, *.openai.azure.com, bedrock-runtime.<region>.amazonaws.com, api.mistral.ai, api.cohere.com/ai, api.together.xyz/ai, api.groq.com, ollama.com, deepseek.com, *.huggingface.co, *.replicate.com, *.runpod.io, *.modal.run.

**(c) Sigma (YAML) — DNS query kategorisi:**
```yaml
