Ek hazır rulesetler: **agentshield-ai/sigma-ai** (`product: ai_agent`, "ignore previous instructions" prompt injection, MCP rug pull), **Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules** (ATR formatı, 425 kural, `atr convert sigma`).

**(d) Wazuh — resmi blog "Managing shadow IT with Wazuh" (Syscollector, rule id 221):**
```xml
<group name="syscollector,">
  <rule id="100310" level="3">
    <if_sid>221</if_sid>
    <field name="type">dbsync_packages</field>
    <description>Syscollector packages event.</description>
  </rule>
  <rule id="100311" level="12">
